{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0190_gskh_005_0010_0190_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0190_0020_0001", "offset": 15, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "更 위에 ‘一’ 형태의 가로획이 있는데 각자인지 분명하지 않다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0190_gskh_005_0010_0190_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0190_0020_0002", "offset": 20, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "▨ [香](安城賢 129쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0190_gskh_005_0010_0190_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0190_0020_0003", "offset": 21, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "▨ [徒](安城賢 129쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0190_gskh_005_0010_0190_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0190_0020_0004", "offset": 30, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "國 원 글자(安城賢 129쪽; 鄭義道 150쪽) ‘国’", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0190_gskh_005_0010_0190_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0190_0020_0005", "offset": 31, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "主 [王](安城賢 129쪽)", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_005_0010_0190_gskh_005_0010_0190_0020", "id": "gskh_005_0010_0190_0020_0006", "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "等 원 글자는 ‘朩’", "type": "각주"}
